  "title": "Deliver Business Value Faster and Easier with Guidewire Cloud Infrastructure",
  "summary": "In his blog “Cortina. Cloud Faster.”, Diego Devalle wrote that “skiing has officially become a part of Guidewire’s culture”. As an avid skier myself, I have to admit that I’m thrilled with this, too. There’s a parallel between modern skis and innovating with Guidewire Cloud: both are much faster and easier to use than in previous versions. What this means for Guidewire Cloud customers is they’ll be able to provide the right insurance to the right markets while increasing efficiency across the entire insurance lifecycle.",
